  },
  "cells": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        23.197341856060575,
        941.4089872957517,
        17.434861742424346
      ],
      "text": "the river or change in the course of the river, provided that such constructions does not cause damage to the",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        49.97441856060607,
        168.33921523692808,
        17.434861742424346
      ],
      "text": "property of another.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        95.34672948232321,
        941.4166580473858,
        17.434861742424346
      ],
      "text": "ARTICLE 58. When a river or stream suddenly changes its course to traverse private lands, the owners of the",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        122.1239614898991,
        941.4224864787583,
        17.43486174242412
      ],
      "text": "affected lands may not compel the government to restore the river to its former bed; nor can they restrain the",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        148.9010252525253,
        941.4071449754904,
        17.434861742424232
      ],
      "text": "government from taking steps to revert the river or stream to its former course. The owners of the lands thus",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        175.6781019570708,
        941.409389256536,
        17.434861742424232
      ],
      "text": "affected are not entitled to compensation for any damage sustained thereby. However, the former owners of",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        202.455165719697,
        788.4824709558825,
        17.434861742424232
      ],
      "text": "the new bed shall be the owners of the abandoned bed in proportion to the area lost by each.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        247.82764488636371,
        941.3974309232027,
        17.43486174242412
      ],
      "text": "The owners of the affected lands may undertake to return the river or stream to its old bed at their own",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        274.6047086489899,
        941.4089872957517,
        17.434861742424346
      ],
      "text": "expense; Provided, That a permit therefor is secured from the Secretary of Public Works, Transportation and",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        301.3817853535354,
        941.4070444852941,
        17.434861742424346
      ],
      "text": "Communication and work pertaining thereto are commenced within two years from the change in the course",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        328.1588491161616,
        183.65569644607845,
        17.434861742424232
      ],
      "text": "of the river or stream.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        373.5311212121213,
        941.4128729166666,
        17.43490056818166
      ],
      "text": "ARTICLE 59. Rivers, lakes and lagoons may, upon the recommendation of the Philippine Coast Guard, be",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        400.30823674242424,
        376.17481409313723,
        17.434900568181888
      ],
      "text": "declared navigable either in whole or in part.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        445.68066414141424,
        941.4204264297387,
        17.434900568181774
      ],
      "text": "ARTICLE 60. The rafting of logs and other objects on rivers and lakes which are Xoatable may be controlled or",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        472.4577408459596,
        941.3929423611112,
        17.434900568181774
      ],
      "text": "prohibited during designated season of the year with due regard to the needs of irrigation and domestic water",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        499.2348434343435,
        266.5354713643791,
        17.434900568181774
      ],
      "text": "supply and other uses of water.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        544.6072837752525,
        941.4225869689543,
        17.43490056818183
      ],
      "text": "ARTICLE 61. The impounding of water in ponds or reservoirs may be prohibited by the Council upon",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        571.384231060606,
        941.4057213643792,
        17.43490056818183
      ],
      "text": "consultation with the Department of Health if it is dangerous to public health, or it may order that such pond or",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        598.1614630681818,
        637.063759763072,
        17.43490056818183
      ],
      "text": "reservoir be drained if such is necessary for the protection of public health.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        643.5337351641415,
        941.4086858251635,
        17.43490056818183
      ],
      "text": "ARTICLE 62. Waters of a stream may be stored in a reservoir by a permittee in such amount as will not",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        670.3108377525252,
        941.3989717728758,
        17.434900568181774
      ],
      "text": "prejudice the right of any permittee downstream. Whoever operates the reservoir shall, when required, release",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        697.0880568181818,
        272.77294808006536,
        17.43487468434347
      ],
      "text": "water for minimum stream Xow.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        742.4603418560606,
        941.4191033088235,
        17.43488762626265
      ],
      "text": "All reservoir operations shall be subject to rules and regulations issued by the Council or any proper",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        769.2374315025253,
        172.3319754493464,
        17.434887626262622
      ],
      "text": "government agency.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        814.6097424242424,
        941.4065252859477,
        17.434887626262622
      ],
      "text": "ARTICLE 63. The operator of a dam for the storage of water may be required to employ an engineer",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        841.3868320707071,
        917.1500175245098,
        17.434887626262622
      ],
      "text": "possessing qualiacations prescribed for the proper operations, maintenance and administration of the dam.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        886.7592206439394,
        941.3993737336601,
        17.434877272727263
      ],
      "text": "ARTICLE 64. The Council shall approve the manner, location, depth, and spacing in which borings for",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        913.5362986426768,
        941.3993737336601,
        17.4348798611111
      ],
      "text": "subterranean or ground water may be made, determine the requirements for the registration of every boring or",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        940.3134685290404,
        941.4126719362746,
        17.434879861111114
      ],
      "text": "alteration to existing borings as well as other control measures for the exploitation of subterranean or ground",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.789100939542486,
        967.0905400568182,
        941.410628635621,
        17.434883743686868
      ],
      "text": "water resources, and in coordination with the Professional Regulation Commission prescribe the qualiacations",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/PVVILW+Roboto-Regular",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
